
[app] MG2550s open app
app_flash=0x00010000
app_ram=0x20020000
[app] usb up, entering main loop
[btn] map 2
[btn] B/W=one stock paper advance; release between presses; Cancel=stop; no firing
[home] stock PI seek + verified backoff + repeat seek; mechanical reference
[page] USB stop-and-capture page scan; returns home; Cancel=stop
[escl] eSCL over IPP-USB (interfaces 2-3)
[cart] USB 0x62 reads cartridge fuse ROM (read-only); 0x63 status
[head] USB 0x81 stationary black prefire (stock ID24 list); 0x82 status
